iox-cpp provides CMake package targets under the iox:: namespace.

Basic use:

    find_package(iox CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(app PRIVATE iox::xtf iox::core)

The `ilic` feature adds the model-aware target:

    find_package(iox CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(app PRIVATE iox::ilic)

The `geos` feature enables GEOS-backed geometry validation in iox::geometry.
